Śatrughna humbly accepts unavoidable royal order --- Rāma orders consecration materials and ministers assembled --- Śatrughna receives royal consecration amid delight --- Rāma seats Śatrughna on lap and gives divine arrow --- Rāma recounts arrow forged to kill Madhu and Kaiṭabha --- Rāma warns spear burns challenger unless left in house --- Rāma instructs challenge Lavaṇa weaponless outside city gate --- Rāma declares Lavaṇa slayable only by that method